<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus Popular H1 pre-tax gain up 13.2pct.</title>
<headline>Cyprus Popular H1 pre-tax gain up 13.2pct.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>(In millions of Cyprus pounds)</p>
<p>					  96		95</p>
<p>    Operating profit	    18.198    vs  16.081</p>
<p>    Provision for bad debt     4.046    vs   3.174</p>
<p>    Corporate tax		  4.212    vs   3.933</p>
<p>    Profit after tax	     9.940    vs   8.974</p>
<p>    Earning per share (cents)   13.1    vs    12.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Cyprus Popular Bank Ltd.</p>
<p>Bank chairman Kikis Lazarides told a news conference the results are considered 'especially satisfying'.</p>
<p>-- Michele Kambas, Nicosia newsroom 357 2 365089</p>
</text>
